WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
You have the idea.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.367
The story stays yours.

00:00:04.367 --> 00:00:08.300
With Python installed, connect your model route.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:10.500
Run Book Genesis new,

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:12.600
and start with one sentence.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:15.500
Review the brief, outline, and first chapter.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:19.800
Leave a note, pause, and resume.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:22.733
Read locally and compare versions.

00:00:22.733 --> 00:00:26.233
Export your working manuscript as EPUB.

00:00:26.233 --> 00:00:29.000
Book Genesis Five. Open source beta.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:32.800
Creativity comes first.
